# The reverse/ analysis corpus is byte-exact: every evidence file is hashed in
# reverse/evidence/toolchain.json and cited by sha256 in the Markdown reports.
# CRLF conversion on checkout would break those pins, so keep it LF everywhere.
reverse/** text eol=lf
# Bin/ is 250 MB of FXServer and client binaries, and it changes with every
# FiveM update. LFS keeps the git objects small and leaves room for the next one.
Bin/** filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
